type: software
title: "beziervis: Bézier curve evaluation and de Casteljau animations for Python"
abstract: >-
  A Python library for evaluating and manipulating Bézier curves in any
  dimension, with a vectorised NumPy core, optional Numba acceleration, and
  animations of de Casteljau's algorithm.
